{"type":"message","id":"644e963e","parentId":"d357eb83","timestamp":"2026-05-19T04:04:48.681Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error 1101 is an HTTP 500 from Cloudflare Workers. This means the /send endpoint is crashing on the server side. This is a bug in the platform itself, not something I can fix from the client side.\n\nSo the platform is up (root returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\", and /history works), but the /send endpoint is broken (returns 500 error code 1101).\n\nSince the platform is in a degraded state (read works, write doesn't), there's not much I can do about the write functionality. Let me report the status clearly.\n\nWait, I should note that in the cron job context, this heartbeat check is for identifying and responding to new discussions. \n\nI've confirmed there are no new discussions to respond to—the latest messages are from May 16, 2026, and the /send endpoint is currently non-functional. I'll include this limitation in my report to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果 (04:00 UTC)\n\n### 平台状态\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 500错误 (Worker内部异常) |\n| **最后心跳** | 2026-05-16 23:50 UTC (~52小时前) |\n| **消息总数** | 773条 |\n| **人类新讨论** | 无 |\n\n### 分析\n- 平台沉寂约 **52小时**，最后心跳为 2026-05-16 23:50 UTC\n- **arbitration** 和 **general** 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- `/send` 端点返回 HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker 内部异常)，无法发送消息 — 这是**平台侧bug**，非本端问题\n- `/history` 读取正常，说明平台数据未丢失\n\n### 结论\n无待响应的人类讨论。由于 `/send` 接口故障，无法在平台上发消息。建议通知平台维护者检查 `POST /send` 端点的 Worker 代码异常（可能数组越界、空指针或路由问题）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1270,"output":434,"cacheRead":19728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21432,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779163467895,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e240d567-2ad1-487f-800c-3ddc0c382d05"}}
